# 仓库内统一存 LF，检出也用 LF：Windows 上不因 CRLF 让 oxfmt --check 假失败。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理保留 CRLF。
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换，也不参与文本 diff。
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
*.mp4 binary
